(* README *)

1 - Overview
    --------

    This directory contains the formal theory packages of Proofcase Export.

    Package prefixes indicate the role of a development:

      A##  Algorithms and effective methods.
      D##  Formalizations.
      P##  Proof packages establishing named mathematical statements.


2 - Index
    -----

    A001

      CARRYLESS PAIRING

      Certified pairing and unpairing of natural numbers using the Fibonacci
      base.

    D001

      VECTOR ITERANT

      A two-counter machine encoded into one natural number, with structured,
      encoded, and classical execution views.

    P001

      PIGEONHOLE DIVISIBILITY

      A formal proof that among any `n + 1` distinct positive integers chosen
      from `1` through `2n`, two are related by divisibility.

    P002

      CUBIC-FAMILY Σ₁ COMPLETENESS

      A Diophantine representation theorem for finite families of cubic
      equations over the natural numbers, using the carryless arithmetization
      supplied by A001 and D001.
